#: indi/recordingoptions.ui:154 indi/recordingoptions.ui:212
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>\n"
"<p>Set SER video file name. Record files may contain some patterns to make "
"them dynamic:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><b>_D_</b> for the date in YYYY-MM-DD.</li>\n"
